      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "And on the flip side, don't have it be possible to remove locomotion on (public) avatars that are using Unity's Humanoid system. The number of times I see a really nice public avatar that was rendered useless because it just slides around everywhere is absurd.\nShould have never been a avatar upload setting to begin with.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
